# Styles: heavy, death, power, progressive
# 7/8=14 steps | 5/4=10 steps | 3/4=6 steps | 9/8=18 steps | 11/8=22 steps
# Beat groups: 7/8=3+2+2, 5/4=3+2, 9/8=3+3+3, 11/8=3+3+3+2
# X = accented hit, x = regular hit, . = rest, o = soft, g = ghost

